From: ininjagod98 <181880040+ininjagod98@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 18:05:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Minemora - cache LivingEntity health

LivingEntity#getHealth reads DATA_HEALTH_ID out of SynchedEntityData on every
call: a hash lookup plus an unbox. isAlive() calls it, and EAR calls isAlive()
for every entity every tick, so a survival server profile attributed 1.05% of
the tick to ActivationRange#checkIfActive -> isAlive -> getHealth alone, and
2.81% to SynchedEntityData#get overall.

The value only changes through SynchedEntityData#set, which fires
onSyncedDataUpdated on every actual change, so a mirrored field stays exact.
The field is initialised to the same 1.0F that defineSynchedData registers, so
it is still correct for an entity whose max health equals that default and whose
constructor set() is therefore a no-op. ServerPlayer keeps going through the
Bukkit scaled-health path untouched.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/LivingEntity.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/LivingEntity.java
index f61dac983c5e7cfa86173112d9731c26d6769bd5..efc35d473dd72a97df0638fa94163a4469d78f53 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/entity/LivingEntity.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/entity/LivingEntity.java
@@ -1437,13 +1437,21 @@ public abstract class LivingEntity extends Entity implements Attackable, Waypoin
         }
     }
 
+    // Minemora start - cache health
+    // Mirrors DATA_HEALTH_ID. Initialised to the exact value defineSynchedData registers,
+    // so the two agree even when the constructor's set(getMaxHealth()) is a no-op because
+    // the entity's max health happens to equal that default. Kept in sync by
+    // onSyncedDataUpdated, which SynchedEntityData#set fires on every actual change.
+    private float minemora$cachedHealth = 1.0F;
+    // Minemora end - cache health
+
     public float getHealth() {
         // CraftBukkit start - Use unscaled health
         if (this instanceof ServerPlayer player) {
             return (float) player.getBukkitEntity().getHealth();
         }
         // CraftBukkit end
-        return this.entityData.get(DATA_HEALTH_ID);
+        return this.minemora$cachedHealth; // Minemora - cache health
     }
 
     // Paper start - Check for NaN
@@ -4505,6 +4513,11 @@ public abstract class LivingEntity extends Entity implements Attackable, Waypoin
     @Override
     public void onSyncedDataUpdated(final EntityDataAccessor<?> accessor) {
         super.onSyncedDataUpdated(accessor);
+        // Minemora start - cache health
+        if (DATA_HEALTH_ID.equals(accessor)) {
+            this.minemora$cachedHealth = this.entityData.get(DATA_HEALTH_ID);
+        }
+        // Minemora end - cache health
         if (SLEEPING_POS_ID.equals(accessor)) {
             if (this.level().isClientSide()) {
                 this.getSleepingPos().ifPresent(this::setPosToBed);
